iv>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>59.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Womb\" title=\"Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Stage_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073122\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utero\" title=\"Utero\"><img alt=\"Stage Utero icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Utero icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Utero_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3d/Stage_Utero_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073102\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarred_Womb\" title=\"Scarred Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/af/Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073303\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Room\" title=\"Boss Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Boss_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102031\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div style=\"padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 25px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Questionmarkisaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Questionmarkisaac.png\" data-image-key=\"Questionmarkisaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1d/Questionmarkisaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825083347\" /></span></span> <i>For the boss with a similar name, see <a href=\"/wiki/Mr._Fred\" title=\"Mr. Fred\">Mr. Fred</a>.</i></div>\n<p><br />\n<b>Fred</b> is a monster that can be encountered in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chapter 4\">Chapter 4</a>.\n</p><p>Fred fires an explosive <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Ipecac&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ipecac\" title=\"Ipecac\"><img alt=\"Collectible Ipecac icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Ipecac icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Ipecac_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/13/Collectible_Ipecac_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821080140\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ipecac\" title=\"Ipecac\">Ipecac</a></span> shot at Isaac. Fred can also jump out of the ground and towards Isaac and then dive back in, shooting four blood shots in the cardinal directions when it does so. It usually does this after firing an Ipecac shot or if Isaac is far away.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>In the original game, the shots that Freds fired when they dive back into the ground traveled diagonally instead of in the cardinal directions.</li>\n<li>Freds appear to be babies with the medical condition <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harlequin_Ichthyosis\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Harlequin Ichthyosis\">harlequin ichthyosis</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/